On-device AI means using AI models or tools that are trained and developed locally, without relying on external data or services. It's like having a personalized AI system, similar to how a smartphone uses its own data, without connecting to the internet. This can be for tasks like language, image recognition, or other applications. It helps in creating more accurate and efficient AI experiences.

